{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, You've been hired as the new nightshift employee at silver lake gas station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely and isolated gas station on the outskirts of a forgotten highway town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tasks are simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >restock shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >monitor the pumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and keep the register in check</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but there are some special rules which you must not forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 1)</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a car pulls up to the pump with no headlights on, fill their car but never look inside the vehicle. Then go back to the station and it will leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/cc824eb89f53055615c6389578887376.avif?t=1767867886\" width=735 height=715 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 2)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the lights go out, don\u2019t panic. Calmly go to the fusebox inside the storage and turn it back on, NEVER\u2026 RUN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/e6ef9f3fe60592ec0fbcc482979dd69c.avif?t=1767867886\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 3)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear a long honk coming from the pump area but no vehicle is present. close the door immediately, crouch behind the counter until it stops, no matter what you hear outside</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/60ee3b2e55cbcc861a97b9b96c8ec098.avif?t=1767867886\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 4)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a customer offers to pay with an old silver coin accept it without question and put it in your pocket. Don\u2019t play with it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/b78801e5fdc5f526a62a01223454151f.avif?t=1767867886\" width=800 height=534 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 5)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you receive a call asking if John Redner is there, answer yes. go to the bathroom, lock yourself and wait until everything starts to sound normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/aaa407150e88af4d8497630a0a295db2.avif?t=1767867886\" width=612 height=408 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 6)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see your own car pull up even though you know you didnt drive there, hide in the supply room until sunrise. do not engage. Of course, you will be compensated for your whole shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/af965e027449561c3f8d6349aae8ad1d.avif?t=1767867886\" width=800 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it through the whole shift?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gas Station : Graveyard Shift\u00a0</strong>is a atmospheric horror game that takes place in an isolated gas station\u00a0where you work the night shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're desperate for money, and this is the only job offer you got. Don't mess this up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good night, and good luck!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854230?t=1767867886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854230?t=1767867886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/f03cb2ab32cf1c9f58624771fea80e3ec056d8ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767867886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/f03cb2ab32cf1c9f58624771fea80e3ec056d8ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767867886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4213790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, You've been hired as the new nightshift employee at silver lake gas station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely and isolated gas station on the outskirts of a forgotten highway town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tasks are simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >restock shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >monitor the pumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and keep the register in check</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but there are some special rules which you must not forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 1)</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a car pulls up to the pump with no headlights on, fill their car but never look inside the vehicle. Then go back to the station and it will leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/cc824eb89f53055615c6389578887376.avif?t=1767867886\" width=735 height=715 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 2)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the lights go out, don\u2019t panic. Calmly go to the fusebox inside the storage and turn it back on, NEVER\u2026 RUN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/e6ef9f3fe60592ec0fbcc482979dd69c.avif?t=1767867886\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 3)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear a long honk coming from the pump area but no vehicle is present. close the door immediately, crouch behind the counter until it stops, no matter what you hear outside</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/60ee3b2e55cbcc861a97b9b96c8ec098.avif?t=1767867886\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 4)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a customer offers to pay with an old silver coin accept it without question and put it in your pocket. Don\u2019t play with it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/b78801e5fdc5f526a62a01223454151f.avif?t=1767867886\" width=800 height=534 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 5)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you receive a call asking if John Redner is there, answer yes. go to the bathroom, lock yourself and wait until everything starts to sound normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/aaa407150e88af4d8497630a0a295db2.avif?t=1767867886\" width=612 height=408 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>rule 6)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see your own car pull up even though you know you didnt drive there, hide in the supply room until sunrise. do not engage. Of course, you will be compensated for your whole shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/extras/af965e027449561c3f8d6349aae8ad1d.avif?t=1767867886\" width=800 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it through the whole shift?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gas Station : Graveyard Shift\u00a0</strong>is a atmospheric horror game that takes place in an isolated gas station\u00a0where you work the night shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're desperate for money, and this is the only job offer you got. Don't mess this up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good night, and good luck!</p>","developers":["Trident"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854230/a7e3a9f8f8cf3a2f007bb15035302b56b98ddbef/header.jpg?t=1767867886","is_free":fa